From 72ffad8d1b2234b1d2d6ddbab395641becb5c29e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:38:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ac, am, ldr_ro, video_core: stubs and gaps found in the game
 library sweep

- ac:u/ac:i: GetLastErrorCode and GetLastDetailErrorCode (0x000A/0x000B, error 0),
  SetNetworkArea (0x0025, config handed back), GetConnectingSecurityMode (0x0033, open),
  GetConnectingSsid / GetConnectingSsidLength (0x0034/0x0035, the same virtual access point
  GetCurrentAPInfo reports).
- am:app: IsDataTitleInUse (0x1009): no add-on title is ever busy.
- ldr_ro: CRO relocations for ARM branches (R_ARM_CALL incl. BLX into Thumb, R_ARM_JUMP24),
  Thumb BL/BLX (R_ARM_THM_CALL) and R_ARM_PREL31, which were unimplemented (Mario Sports
  Superstars loading/unloading the uniform_core CRO). Clearing keeps branch instructions;
  the reset batches point them at the unresolved-symbol handler.
- video_core: texture types 5-7 no longer log a critical error / stop debug builds
  (type 7 in Mario Sports Superstars); rendering unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
